; The member's own choice of keymaster.
FORM KEYMASTER
TITLE Accept or refuse a keymaster
SUMMARY Your choice of whose authority this box takes key tapes from. Accepting needs the fingerprint read to you by voice or in person.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 70
ACTION keymaster_accept WHEN answer=ACCEPT
ACTION keymaster_refuse WHEN answer=REFUSE
FIELD station Station(@cards) required
FIELD answer Your answer(ACCEPT,REFUSE) required
FIELD fingerprint Fingerprint read to you(X) upper check=fingerprint
FIELD how How you checked it(BY VOICE,IN PERSON) default=BY VOICE
NEXT KEY_OPEN HANDOUT_LOAD
BEGIN_HELP
Your answer:
This is yours to decide. Refusing keeps their cards and plain traffic, but this box takes no tape from them.
END

Fingerprint read to you:
Needed to accept: four groups of four, read off their screen.
END
